        {
            id = 2880773,
            score = 3,
            author = "mindaz3",
            text = "As far as I can understand, this quest have the lowest ID on Alliance side currently.\n\nIf you quest through [zone=12], you will notice that there are more low ID quests, most them are old vanilla quests, but updated for Cataclysm. Meanwhile all other areas that you quest in have high ID quests. For example, [zone=40], [zone=44] or other starting zones, like [zone=14] or [zone=1] have just a few or none at all low ID quests. In all this, I would assume when Blizzard started working on Cataclysm, first they started updating old quests, but later on decided just to remove old quests completely and replace them with new ones in other zones.",
            date = "2019-04-08T03:52:46-05:00",
