            id = 2465036,
            score = 22,
            author = "500rwcoupe",
            text = "For those looking for Patched Pants for xmog but Guard Thomas doesn't have the quest, follow the chain at the link below.\n\nSpeak to Remy \"Two Times\" in Goldshire for the quest \"A Fishy Peril\" which directs you to Marshal Dughan.\n\nThat leads you to speak with Guard Thomas via quest \"Further Concerns.\"\n\nGuard Thomas sends you on a quest called \"Find the Lost Guards\" and a couple of steps later, you get the armor quest for the Patched Pants.\n\n[quest=37 domain=www]",
