            author = "63649",
            text = "Oh, and those 2 roads you can choose from.. Go left, that's the shortest way to Stormpike. When you get through the gate and in to Loch Modan there's a circular fort. He's inside at the top. Coordinates are: 24,7;17,6",
            date = "2007-06-19T07:02:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=353#comments:id=106939",
        },
        {
            id = 289482,
            score = 3,
            author = "Jhereg",
            text = "Bastardur is right, but for those of you clicking on coordinates using lightheaded the coordinates are:  24.8, 18.3\n\nHe's at the top of the building in the zone \"Algaz Station\" at the NW portion of the zone-wide map.",
            date = "2008-05-16T20:00:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=353#comments:id=289482",
