            date = "2010-09-11T12:52:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=432#comments:id=1118408",
        },
        {
            id = 1196774,
            score = 3,
            author = "Sully",
            text = "Can think of a few other names for them too, but I won't go there. Just mind your way as they have a knock back and they attack pretty fast.",
            date = "2010-11-29T23:50:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=432#comments:id=1196774",
        },
        {
            id = 1324084,
            score = 3,
            author = "Lurielle",
            text = "Those blasted troggs indeed. Be warned that these troggs hit MUCH harder than before and aggro other troggs close to them if you aggro one.\n\nI hate troggs.\n\nEDIT: Just tested some things out. I aggro'd one about 30 yards away and it aggro'd another which was about 30 yards away from itself. Be careful. If you don't want them to respawn fast then don't loot them. And also look out behind you, I just ran into two while two were chasing me. And they have a knock back stun which is very frustrating if you're trying to heal yourself.\n\nI really hate troggs.",
            date = "2011-02-06T09:59:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=432#comments:id=1324084",
        },
    },
    [433] = {
