            text = "I found the best place to hunt for Rockjaw Bonesnappers is around ronband's Compound is just southwest of Helm's Bed Lake, which is on the Eastern side of Dun Morogh.\n\nFor those of you with Cosmos or Titan Panel add-ons, the coordinates are are around 77,60\n\nNote: If you're a warrior, this quest pairs well with \"Ironband's Compound\" pairs will with this quest, since the ore you're looking for is in the same area. (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=1681)",
