            text = "Begins the hunt quests in STV, which are stackable and give very good XP. The camp is located at 36,11 which you should know already, as you need to be at the camp to get this quest (you just have to talk to a guy on the other side of the camp fire)\n\nThe quest name could possibly be a reference to the famous Guns N' Roses song of the same name (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Welcome_to_the_Jungle).",
            date = "2007-12-07T03:11:13-06:00",
