        },
        {
            id = 6111862,
            score = 3,
            author = "Manbearcow",
            text = "RAVAGED CARAVAN QUEST GUIDE VIDEO - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qxzqHuNF614\n\n-Pick up The Ravaged Caravan from Morin Cloudstalker who patrols the road heading East from Bloodhoof Village towards The Barrens.\n\n-You will find the ravaged caravan on the North side of the large lake North of Bloodhoof Village.\n\n-Caravan is surrounded by level 6-8 Venture Company Laborers and Task Masters.\n\n-Hardcore difficulty is moderate due to the fact that the goblins and gnolls like to run away and call any nearby reinforcements when they get low on health.\n\n-Therefore, it is wise to pull enemies back to avoid aggroing more than you can handle.\n\n-In the center of the encampment, you will find the Sealed Supply Crate next to a fire-pit.\n\n-The crate acts as a quest giver, allowing you to turn in the first part of the quest before grabbing the second part. So be sure to give yourself enough time and space to pick up the second part of the quest. Do not aggro any mobs while waiting for the quest text to populate.\n\n-Once you have the second part of The Ravaged Caravan, you can return to Morin Cloudstalker to receive your rewards.",
            date = "2025-05-13T17:17:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=751#comments:id=6111862",
        },
    },
