            id = 110093,
            score = 9,
            author = "4093",
            text = "Completion of this quest leads to http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=941.",
            date = "2007-06-23T23:39:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=927#comments:id=110093",
        },
        {
            id = 560937,
            score = 9,
            author = "18004",
            text = "funny thing, this guardian kinda comes with your lvl too.\nas lvl 80 it goes berserk in teldrassil, killing everything it sees.\nwish i saved it for a much more awesome place.",
            date = "2009-01-13T12:17:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=927#comments:id=560937",
        },
        {
            id = 14334,
            score = 6,
            author = "9167",
            text = "Blackmoss the Fetid is a rare spawn that takes a long time to respawn near the lake.  You need to be patient in waiting him out.  Once you kill him, bring his moss-twined heart back to Denelan and you'll be rewarded.  You need to right-click the heart to start the quest, and it requires level 5 to start.  You get a gnarlpine to protect you for 20 minutes for the reward.",
            date = "2006-12-12T16:58:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=927#comments:id=14334",
        },
        {
            id = 731265,
            score = 5,
            author = "307206",
            text = "This guy is in a pretty remote area so I found him my last 2 times leveling in the night elf areas.  You get an item that summons an npc guardian from the quest.  He's a n equal level timberling npc and I found two quests in darkshore he could be very useful on for a lowbie night elf.  The mushroom quest has you fight 3 16-18 mobs, and I used him on this one.  He was a pretty effective and tanked 1 guy until I had the other 2 down.  The Wanted: Murkdeep quest also pits you against 3 mobs at one time, so he could be used there as well to the same effect.",
            date = "2009-05-29T14:45:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=927#comments:id=731265",
        },
        {
            id = 1457132,
            score = 5,
            author = "842589",
            text = "I got this quest today (Patch 4.2) on my level 24 Night Elf priest.  I found Blackmoss the Fetid (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3535) on a small hill near the SW part of Lake Al'Ameth (52,63).  He did drop the heart and I was able to turn it in to Denalan.  (Remember, if you have already completed most of the quests in the area, he will have moved to his new location at Wellspring Hovel (44,44.3), which is off the road south of the Oracle Glade.)\n\nAlso worth mentioning, in the follow-up quest Planting the Heart (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=941), I was NOT able to plant the seed in the planter behind Denalan at his Wellspring Hovel location...I had to go to the planter on the East side of Lake Al'Ameth where Denalan first was (59.9,59.8).\n\nHope this helps!",
            date = "2011-07-01T12:59:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=927#comments:id=1457132",
        },
    },
    [929] = {
        {
            id = 1202882,
            score = 19,
            author = "Polegara",
            text = "The moonwell is now at (60,50).\n\nAs you approach it, the Shade of the Kaldorei (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=34583) will spawn to continue his story.\n\nShade of the Kaldorei stares into the moonwell, lost in distant memories.\nShade of the Kaldorei says: The Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed on Nordrassil in ancient times.\nShade of the Kaldorei says: But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance.\nShade of the Kaldorei says: In agreement, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil's growth has been flawed and unpredictable.\nShade of the Kaldorei says: Staghelm retreated to his enclave in Darnassus, ever seeking a new direction by which to bless Teldrassil, and restore the immortality of our people.\nThe Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away.\n\nThere are five of these lore quests in total.\n\nTeldrassil: Crown of Azeroth (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28729)\nTeldrassil: Passing Awareness (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28731)\nTeldrassil: The Refusal of the Aspects\nTeldrassil: The Burden of the Kaldorei (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=7383)\nTeldrassil: The Coming Dawn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=933)",
            date = "2010-12-02T19:54:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=929#comments:id=1202882",
        },
        {
            id = 51649,
            score = 12,
            author = "7452",
            text = "Location of the Moonwell is [63,58].  For those without coords it is due north of the S in the Starbreeze Villiage text on the map.",
            date = "2007-03-15T13:55:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=929#comments:id=51649",
        },
        {
            id = 3201889,
            score = 8,
            author = "Blackmage7",
            text = "After completing the quest when I went back to turn the quest into Shade of the Kaldorei, he isn't anywhere to be seen? So im not sure what to do now, if anyone knows what to do or why he isn't showing up?",
            date = "2020-04-23T20:58:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=929#comments:id=3201889",
        },
        {
            id = 5269955,
            score = 5,
            author = "Anthelior",
            text = "This quest can be accepted by all Alliance races (or at least by Humans too). I was able to pick up this quest with a Human character.",
            date = "2021-10-24T05:31:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=929#comments:id=5269955",
        },
        {
            id = 6327384,
            score = 5,
            author = "Kaliopae",
            text = "Hands in at 55.8 53.8 to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3515.",
            date = "2026-04-09T07:52:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=929#comments:id=6327384",
        },
    },
    [930] = {
        {
            id = 34647,
            score = 55,
            author = "16334",
            text = "http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=918 (Timberling Seeds) and http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=919 (Timberling Sprouts) are prereq for this quest.",
            date = "2007-02-12T12:02:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=930#comments:id=34647",
        },
        {
            id = 1685491,
            score = 34,
            author = "violetta",
            text = "Perhaps its seeds were brought here from far off.  Perhaps even as far as Azeroth!\n\nA rare reminder that the Eastern Kingdoms were once considered to be Azeroth before it was retconned into the name of the planet itself",
            date = "2012-07-07T07:33:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=930#comments:id=1685491",
        },
        {
            id = 172461,
            score = 18,
            author = "Darth3adel",
            text = "the tree that start that quest is located in( 42,76)\nmake sure u grab the other similar quest (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=931) at (35,28)",
            date = "2007-10-21T00:42:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=930#comments:id=172461",
        },
        {
            id = 1655816,
            score = 13,
            author = "gfysprez",
            text = "While farming Darnassus rep on a dwarf it appears that the Cataclysm has uprooted and moved this tree from its \"original\" location to the opposite side of Lake Al'Ameth (co-ords 58 59).\n\nHow this happend without destroying the tree is something for the red-shirted fact checkers to explain. I'm just here with the new location.",
