            text = "I submited a ticket to blizz, asking them to delete the location of Corithras Moonrage from the instructions.\n\n It is a lvl 13 quest after all, and I'd hate for someone that just started playing to hover at the crossroads forever looking for the guy.  However if they just left the instructions as, \"Bring the Filled Vessel to Corithras Moonrage\", it might actually teach new players to use google to find NPC's to finish quest in the first place.",
