            author = "cmppayne26542",
            text = "To save you guys lots of time, because I was circling for about 15 minutes... the simplest path is:\n\nGo across the bridge from the quest giver.\nTake the first right.\n\nKill him, and use the relic.",
            date = "2010-11-23T21:03:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=2561#comments:id=1179227",
        },
        {
            id = 1565164,
            score = 11,
            author = "906779",
            text = "I guess us altoholic's that think we know b/c we did many times before - need to start reading the quest.... as I now noticed it had been said a few times here.... They have changed this quest now - once you turn in the quest that gives you this one - you have to go to Oben Rageclaw - he gives you Druid of the Claw Quest - I had did it in the past where he is walking in a circle under the bridges - but now if you read the quest it tells you to approach the door to the nearby chamber - a cog will appear - open the door and there he is (with a Body Guard) Kill him - click on him and use the rune - to release - then go back to the giver of the quest and your done....",
            date = "2011-11-06T22:33:07-06:00",
