            text = "Open up the dialog (quest (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=2951)) with [The The Sparklematic 5200] (http://www.wowhead.com/?object=142487) and use this macro to make the delivery and completion faster:\n\n/click QuestFrameCompleteButton\n/click QuestFrameCompleteQuestButton\n/click StaticPopup1Button1\n\nSimply spam the macro to finish the quest after you have right-clicked. Simplest and fastest way to deliver all the items is by running between by the two machines close to each other and spamming the macro, saves time on the dialog itself. Oh also, one more thing.. there is a vendor close by (Tink Sprocketwhistle (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=9676)) so pay him a visit to sell some items you loot that you don't wanna keep! ;)",
