        {
            id = 421041,
            score = 20,
            author = "77486",
            text = "To fill the ooze jars:\n\nRight click on the \"Bag of Empty Ooze Containers\" that you were provided with.\nYou will open it to find Empty Pure Sample Jar x 10\nKill any ooze in Un'Goro\nOnce they are dead, target the corpse of the ooze, and right click on an \"Empty Pure Sample Jar\"\nThe end.",
            date = "2008-10-26T15:30:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=4513#comments:id=421041",
        },
        {
            id = 1678972,
            score = 8,
            author = "921728",
            text = "Forget what you knew or thought you knew, and forget about all the quirks and bugs listed here. Just for grins and giggles I tried some of the \"exploits\" (programming errors) in some of these posts, like the rats, Felwood oozes and slimes, and Wailing Caverns oozes - nope invalid targets. Go to Un'goro, if you check the box for \"Show Quest Objectives\" on the world map, you will find two areas in Un'goro. Plenty of Glutinous Oozes to go around, found 10 in one area no problem. Bliz culled the palaeo-beastie herds there as well, so at level, as I was, I rarely argo'd other beasties (except for the Devilsaur that stomped me into the ground - forgot about those! - mage go squishy). Also, one of the bugs, the ability to fill all 10 jars with one ooze - nope not any more: fill one bottle and the corpse despawns. Happy sliming!",
            date = "2012-06-21T03:24:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=4513#comments:id=1678972",
        },
        {
            id = 390641,
            score = 7,
            author = "Immortares",
            text = "http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=6559\n\nPositions of the Glutinous Ooze",
            date = "2008-09-28T09:49:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=4513#comments:id=390641",
        },
        {
            id = 833598,
