            text = "Very simple.  All you need is 30 plain runecloth, farm it, buy it, it doesn't matter.  Hand the 30 cloth in to the questgiver located in the Timbermaw Hold.  Easy experience and the rewards arn't to shabby.\n\nAlso, after the quest is handed in he can now teach you... wait for it... TAILORING!  Because i know I would much rather train tailoring in a dark moldy cave than in a major city.  =) Enjoy.",
