        {
            id = 376072,
            score = 0,
            author = "208539",
            text = "Solução - Português (Portugal)\n\n1º Fale com o NPC Devrak para aceitar a Quest.\n\nhttp://upload.wowhead.com/images/screenshots/78323.jpg\n\n2º Fale novamente com o NPC Devrak e clique em Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.\n\n3º Você irá viajar até Thunder Bluff.\n\n4º Ao chegar a Thunder Bluff, fale com o NPC Ahanu.\n\nhttp://upload.wowhead.com/images/screenshots/34162.jpg\n\n5º Quest terminada.\n\nAutor: Alexandre Nóbrega\n\n_____________________________________________________\n\nSolution - English\n\n1º Talk to the NPC Devrak to accept the Quest.\n\nhttp://upload.wowhead.com/images/screenshots/78323.jpg\n\n2º Speak again with the NPC Devrak and click in Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.\n\n3º You will travel to Thunder Bluff.\n\n4º Coming in Thunder Bluff, talk with the NPC Ahanu.\n\nhttp://upload.wowhead.com/images/screenshots/34162.jpg\n\n5º Quest finished.\n\nAuthor: Alexandre Nóbrega",
            date = "2008-09-14T09:14:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6362#comments:id=376072",
        },
    },
