            text = "has this quest been removed from the game? i'm positive i haven't done this yet, but my Blood Elf can't pick the quest.\n\nEdit: Happened with many other quests as well. Must be a patch notes I missed for quests being removed. Or it's just me? I will confirm this when I started leveling my Undead character.\n\nEdit: Apparently, the quest The Warsong Reports (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=6543) is a prerequisite for these quests.",
            date = "2009-06-14T02:22:00-05:00",
