            text = "I can confirm as of 11/28/2010, that each turn in of 10 dark iron ore will give you 300 rep instead of the old 75.\nIn addition.. fiery cores and lava cores now give 2000 rep per turn in;  1400 per core leather (2) turn in;  ... blood of the mountain I have no clue.\n\nThe updated Thorium Brotherhood rep quests also took me from friendly to halfway through honored.. in about 45 minutes.  I forgot to take note, but they were somewhere around 1 to 2k rep per quest as I recall.",
