        {
            id = 1472524,
            score = 5,
            author = "Korruptio",
            text = "starting from 0/3k neutral, ending with 999/1000 exalted, it cost me 54 https://www.wowhead.com/item=17012 and one https://www.wowhead.com/item=17011. more leather required if you dont have lava core/guildperk which gives u 10% reputation bonus",
            date = "2011-07-17T14:49:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6645#comments:id=1472524",
        },
        {
            id = 1357055,
            score = 4,
            author = "Parrky",
            text = "Or, a total of 30 to go from 0/21000 to exalted. Considering they're pretty cheap on the auction house [server dependent of course] this is a cheap, quick and relatively efficient way of getting exalted.\n\nHere's a macro, run each line once then click on Lokhtos to auto complete the quest.\n/script testframe1=CreateFrame(\"frame\")\n/script testframe2=CreateFrame(\"frame\")\n/script testframe3=CreateFrame(\"frame\")\n/script testframe1:RegisterEvent(\"GOSSIP_SHOW\")\n/script testframe2:RegisterEvent(\"QUEST_PROGRESS\")\n/script testframe3:RegisterEvent(\"QUEST_COMPLETE\")\n/script testframe1:SetScript(\"OnEvent\",function() SelectGossipAvailableQuest(4); end);\n/script testframe2:SetScript(\"OnEvent\",function() CompleteQuest(); end);\n/script testframe3:SetScript(\"OnEvent\",function() GetQuestReward(); end);\n\nCheers Stewart (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Stewart)",
            date = "2011-03-04T06:47:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6645#comments:id=1357055",
        },
        {
            id = 1620596,
            score = 4,
            author = "Phailedname",
            text = "If Parrky's macro scared and confused you as much as it did me, try this.\nI'm sure his works just great though.\n\n---------------\n\nMake this macro and bind it somewhere.\n/click GossipTitleButton4\n/click QuestFrameCompleteButton\n/click QuestFrameCompleteQuestButton\nRight click quest giver, spam keybind, repeat.\n\nCongrats on exalted with [faction=59].",
            date = "2012-02-03T05:38:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6645#comments:id=1620596",
        },
        {
            id = 1641629,
            score = 3,
