    [6801] = {
        {
            id = 1431809,
            score = 22,
            author = "309898",
            text = "We were able to summon this with ease a couple hours ago.  Here's how you do it:\n\nLoot the blood from alliance corpses (I'm reading 150, but I'm pretty sure it's more like 250, which breaks down to maybe 10-15 corpses).  Spam right-click on Primalist Thurloga; which automatically turns in 5 at a time.  Once she's activated, it becomes a bit like an escort quest.  Her and her 3 npc escorts actually do some pretty decent damage along the way too.\n\nShe will work her way to the west side of the field of strife to start the summoning ritual.  When she starts the ritual, 10 players have to click to help her summon Lokholar.  Only click once.  I believe clicking on it multiple times may reset the timer.  He starts out kinda small and weak, gaining power with each killing blow he does.  You can also buff and heal him.  After just a few kills, he becomes ENORMOUS and starts 1 or 2-shotting everything is his path.  As this point, you will be laughing your ass off.  Don't forget to alt-z before filling your hard drive with screenshots! xD\n\nAlso...Lok will wonder around the center of the map for about 10 minutes before beginning his rampage.  You should probably leave a few people to guard him.  He's kinda weak at this point.\n\nAs long as it's not a total zerg-fest, you should have plenty of time and reinforcements to pull this off. glta :)  Long live classic AV!",
            date = "2011-06-01T03:31:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6801#comments:id=1431809",
        },
        {
            id = 602875,
            score = 10,
            author = "Martacus",
            text = "150 blood you have to hand in. Then, Primalist Thurloga will ride with her 3 shamans to a bit outside galvagnars fortress, Then 10 people must assist her summoning. The ice lord will Apear in the field of strife after summoned and he stays there for 10 minuites before moving north. every kill he gets makes him larger and strong. A pretty much assured win if you can get him up north. He is buffable and healable so do so.",
            date = "2009-02-10T09:18:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6801#comments:id=602875",
        },
        {
            id = 232259,
            score = 8,
            author = "SilvaGaidin",
            text = "It takes 150 Blood to summon Lok.  After the Primalist heads to the center of the field, you need 10 people to protect and help summon.  Its not that hard to do if people are actually turning in blood.",
            date = "2008-02-09T15:48:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6801#comments:id=232259",
        },
        {
            id = 3184279,
            score = 5,
            author = "ByucknahTheRed",
            text = "So, Wowhead does not seem to mention it but this quest also rewards 1,500 Honor. I picked it up today, 1/20/2020, and just noticed it grants 1,500 honor for me.",
            date = "2020-01-20T19:45:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=6801#comments:id=3184279",
        },
