            author = "Trylion",
            text = "I can swear I have done most of these quests in Astranaar in the original game classic. But post-Cataclysm my theory is that when they made chapter achievements around that time, they reset the quests and included them all as part of the storyline achievement. I could be wrong but seems very familiar as I did all the quests in this town because we came here every afternoon to fight the horde in PVP battles on the road between Astranaar and Warsong Gulch. I went on for hours. My only question now is I am not getting Darnassus rep as I reached exalted doing Darkshore and Ashenvale storyline, but where is the Alliance rep going? Who is Alliance? Is that a faction or is it being distributed to the big four factions that you have left to reach exalted? I have no idea.",
