        {
            id = 2615592,
            score = 12,
            author = "Premeditated",
            text = "So this is confusing, and not at all obvious...\n\nTo turn in this quest, you go back to the brazier and interact with it, whereupon your character (or, if you're on an RP server YOU...) will throw the Secret Signal Powder/Potion into the fire and then Krokk will come sneaking up the hill to allow you to turn the quest in.",
