            text = "He's inside the Raynewood Retreat tower, at the very top, at 62.0, 51.4. Has 2 adds with him.",
            date = "2010-11-27T09:48:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13962#comments:id=1190072",
        },
        {
            id = 1536410,
            score = 7,
            author = "rowaasr13",
            text = "Wait, Horde are up to killing keepers yet again and kills cenarion members on the way? That's some... unique... honor.",
