        {
            id = 1799093,
            score = 28,
            author = "WokkaD",
            text = "Notes :\n1. this is a timed quest. You have 2 hours to complete it after ACCEPTING.\n2. the robes have a 2 hour life. If they stay in your bag for 2 hours, they will disappear.\n3. Do not log out or do any other quest or exploration.\n4. this quest should take about 15 mins to complete.\n5. for those who do NOT have Timbermaw Hold rep, don't worry. This quest does not create a TH rep status / bar.\n6. you will meet them again in Felwood, where you can gain rep with them.\n7. i think that the last statement on the first page went directly to the last page which includes \"\". Be ready to defend yourself when you get to the \"belly button\" page.\n8. as a Goblin Hunter, my pet was on \"assist\". It did not attack until i was attacked.\n9. the disguise will re-appear in your bags when you leave the hold.\n10. the way out is UP the ramp / stairs to the right of the Chieftan , over the smooth bridge, taking the left fork on the bridge.\n11. no need to farm within the hold. There are 4 of each on the way out.",
            date = "2013-01-15T15:33:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14435#comments:id=1799093",
        },
        {
            id = 1284502,
