            author = "727907",
            text = "Gorthak is lvl 22, with 702 life.\n\nI only saw  4 hostiles near him , 2 x lvl 20 shamans and 2 x lvl 19 grunts,  as the 5th guy, a lvl 25 blood elf was not \"active\", meaning I could not engage him.",
