            date = "2011-06-26T13:01:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26466#comments:id=1451135",
        },
        {
            id = 1606318,
            score = 8,
            author = "ArcticPrince",
            text = "Lvl 21 Mage here and I had quite a bit of problem killing this one.  After dying twice, I decided to follow some advice posted here and killed all of the NPC around the island.  I then killed Ruuzel, only to die at the hands of a crab!  LOL\n\nI did get back and claimed the ring.....",
            date = "2012-01-04T06:31:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26466#comments:id=1606318",
        },
        {
