            text = "I had a hard time figuring out where he was because the map makes it seem like he's on top of the hill which you can't get up. He is actually at the bottom of the hill on the bottom right corner of the lake. Once you get there you'll see the torches to guide you to him. Make sure you use the rod before you aggro him so you don't have to wait for him to re-spawn. Do not kill him.",
