            text = "looks like this quest doesn't exist in game anymore.",
            date = "2011-06-02T01:06:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28876#comments:id=1432466",
        },
        {
            id = 2031045,
            score = 3,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "I'm inclined to agree that this quest has been removed due to the similar title, but there is other possibilities that comes to mind:\n\nSince this quest has the pre-requisite of Warchief's Command: Ashenvale (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28493) which is essentially a short-cut quest from Orgrimmar, I see no reason to remove this quest. Instead, it would simply be invalidated by Ashenvale version, and vice versa.\n\nI can't confirm this though, as I choose the Durator-Northern Barrens route. This route includes a looose chain of caravan based quests which start with Crossroads Caravan Pickup (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13949) and finish with Mor'shan Caravan Delivery (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29111) which I believe serves an alternative to this quest.\n\nFollowing the quest-chain will eventually lead you to Thork who gives the Mor'shan Caravan Pickup (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29109) quest which, after a few more quests in the chain, the final being Mor'shan Caravan Delivery (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29111), leads you directly to Kadrak..",
            date = "2014-11-14T17:51:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28876#comments:id=2031045",
        },
