        {
            id = 5787867,
            score = 3,
            author = "auryunderground",
            text = "The NPC dialogue that goes along with this quest (as an Alliance Dracthyr):\n[spoiler]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=181494 says: Wha... what... ! What has happened? Who did this to us?\n\nDervishian glides down into the room below and then runs for a nearby hall.\n\nDervishian says: Something is very wrong here. We must find our wing mates. This way!\n\nDervishian leaves the player behind, with the expectation that they will follow. In a nearby room, the player finds https://www.wowhead.com/npc=181712, who was crushed to death long ago. Clicking on him reveals the following message:\n\nOn the way to the hall,  the player finds a dracthyr named https://www.wowhead.com/npc=181680 and frees him from his bonds.\n\nTethalash says: I remember... obeying an order.\n\nTethalash runs off in the same direction as Dervishian. The player follows, and when they get close to the hall a blue dragon named Lapisagos (https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Lapisagos) can be heard shouting, \"The dracthyr (https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Dracthyr) are breaking free! Contain them!\"\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=181596 says: In here, evoker.\n\nThe player joins Dervishian, a dracthyr named https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186946, and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186864. In front of them stands https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183380, stuck in stasis until the player frees him.\n\nKodethi says: How long were we held in stasis?\n\nDervishian says: A very long time, by the look of our creche.\n\nScalecommander Azurathel says: Ungh... my head... Alright, we need to get our bearings.\n\n[/spoiler]",
            date = "2024-02-17T08:30:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=64864#comments:id=5787867",
        },
    },
