            text = "If the quest giver right slips past the magic barrier and you can't pick it up, log out and back in. He'll be there and you can get through.",
            date = "2022-11-15T17:07:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=64866#comments:id=5470515",
        },
        {
            id = 5788178,
            score = 1,
            author = "auryunderground",
            text = "The NPC dialogue in the cutscene and quest:\n[spoiler]\nA short cutscene begins to play as soon as players accept this quest:\n\nScalecommander Azurathel: Cindrethresh!\nScalecommander Azurathel: Can you bring down this barrier?\n\nCindrethresh is thrilled to see the other dracthyr just on the other side of the doorway. She moves a large crystal into its focus setting, and the barrier drops.\n\nScalecommander Cindrethresh: Zury!\nScalecommander Cindrethresh: Just the reinforcements I needed!\n\nScalecommander Azurathel: Have you found the Earth-Warder (https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Deathwing)?\n\nScalecommander Cindrethresh: No. He is not in this chamber.\nScalecommander Cindrethresh: But there is--\n\nA sudden roar erupts from somewhere below and the group runs to look down into the Earth-Warder's Cauldron, where a large blue dragon (https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Lapisagos) has assembled a small army of drakonids (https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Drakonid).\n\nScalecommander Azurathel: ...A different dragon.\n\nLapisagos: Come forth, loyal servants of Malygos (https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Malygos)!\nLapisagos: Show no mercy to these aberrations!\n\nScalecommander Cindrethresh: Well, this should be fun!\n\nAs soon as the cutscene ends, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=181597 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=182696 begin gliding down to the next platform.\n\nScalecommander Cindrethresh says: What do you remember, Zury? Before the stasis?\n\nScalecommander Azurathel says: Only fragments. A battle against a great foe. We claimed victory... I think. Though I fear we paid a terrible price for it.\n\nScalecommander Cindrethresh says: We will find answers. But first, we need to get our people out of here.\n\nScalecommander Azurathel says: By wing or by talon, we will see it done.\n\nThe player assists several dracthyr while making their way to the north side of the Earth-Warder's Cauldron where the rest of the group is waiting on a staircase.\n\nScalecommander Azurathel says: That dragon is going to collapse our only way out!\n\n[/spoiler]",
            date = "2024-02-17T21:58:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=64866#comments:id=5788178",
        },
    },
