        },
        {
            id = 6297034,
            score = 19,
            author = "Garadronk",
            text = "So yeah this is still bugged, or completely unbalanced. I get that it could show how dangerous T'era is or something, but seriously, the damage she does is unbalanced af.\nUnless this is some hidden item lvl limit bs.\n\nAnyway, I did it like this, attacked her, valiantly died 4 times, due to T'eras immense skills obviously, but last time luckily close to her being at 33~%HP, resurrected after her channel and fought some more and then done. At 30%HP T'era apparently has better things and you're done.\nMy idea is that if you're having a tougher time and dying, let Arator and Alleria do some of the damage while you wait for T'era to get low enough and then get back up and kill.\n\nIf they can't do their job properly, we cheese.\n\nEDIT: Also had to abandon the quest and try again, but that might have been because I died at T'era being around 31%HP or something close, and while flying back to get back the cutscene probably should have started. When I got back up and got her to 1%HP she just did not care.",
            date = "2026-03-03T19:43:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86542#comments:id=6297034",
        },
    },
