        {
            id = 6436810,
            score = 1,
            author = "eastwyd",
            text = "Opening Lothraxion's dialogue before quest acceptance says:\n\n\"I have seen hundreds, no, thousands of worlds across the Great Dark Beyond.\nWe Fought the Legion. These were worlds plunged into war and darkness.\nAnd yet, still, none were like this. This foul taste in the mouth--this chill.\nThere is something ever darker here. Xal'atath.\"\n\nbut in the quest text, he states:\n\n\"Ha! A distant realm, crawling with vicious evil monsters? Just like old times.\nAlleria, Turalyon, and I faced a thousand years of war with demons in the far-flung realms. It is as simple a solution now as it was then.\nKill or be killed.\"\n\nWeird incongruity.",
            date = "2026-09-27T02:57:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86557#comments:id=6436810",
        },
    },
    [86558] = {
        {
            id = 6300022,
            score = 9,
            author = "Hazahell",
            text = "The texts as a Void Elf are different :\n\nDescription :\n\nThe Void here. It is like nothing else. I know you feel it, too. I'm proud that you pulled through.\n\nWe must do something to stabilize the area. I'm barely able to keep our escape route from imploding, and the rest of our scouts... I can only hope they can hold it together.\n\nOur ren'dorei know what to do. They will place Shadestar Loci to protect this area, but will need your help activating them.\n\nCompletion :\n\nYou void elves risk corruption, and yet are most suited to understanding the world around us. We need your expertise, but cannot trust you.\n\nIt irks me, but I have already sent for more scouts.",
            date = "2026-03-06T14:39:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86558#comments:id=6300022",
        },
    },
