            text = "Also unable to turn it in.\n\nTried leaving the zone entirely, reloading, and relogging. Gave up and logged out for the night hoping that the daily reset would fix it.\n\nStill nothing the next day. Abandoned the quest, redid it, still can't turn it in so bug report it is I suppose.\n\nEdit 03/06/2026: I am an idiot.\n\nI forgot I turned off error messages with Leatrix Plus to avoid the Lua error popup, but that also includes things like \"You must choose a quest reward\" and apparently I can't read and didn't see the \"choose reward\" text over the items, so I wasn't clicking on either item, so the \"complete quest\" button was doing nothing.\n\nDisabled all addons, tried to turn it in and got the \"You must choose a quest reward\" message and immediately wanted to crawl in a hole and die for playing this game for 10+ years and somehow not noticing that.\n\nBe smarter than me.",
            date = "2026-03-04T18:34:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86659#comments:id=6297929",
