            author = "Raa007",
            text = "If you have completed A Voice from the Light (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=88719/a-voice-from-the-light), whether you are on this or subsequent quests from the instanced version of the Sunwell and have been ported out, you can't fly back to pick up where you left off, nor will you have Light's Summon (https://www.wowhead.com/item=239151/lights-summon) in your bags as it is removed.\n\nInstead you'll need to head back to Silvermoon City where the Image of Lady Liadrin (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=241677/image-of-lady-liadrin) is, and you can be teleported back to the instance.\nYou can also find the image in Dornogal, and likely your faction's capital city as well.\n\nBonus tip: If you walk into the Sunwell's water, you'll die.",
